  "implementationContracts": [
    "Existing valid MIR2_NATIVE_CAPTURE_DIR is the only opt-in; normal startup uses unprofiled PackStore.",
    "Profiled opening authenticates all packs and runs unchanged twenty required startup resource reads before mount.",
    "Capture request freezes cumulative verified successful reads and failure/overflow/poison counters; later reads do not mutate that snapshot.",
    "Separate resource-reads diagnostic binds the authenticated generation/catalog, request frame/scene and final PNG SHA256.",
    "Diagnostic is create-only using fsynced private bytes and atomic no-clobber hard-link publication; collision does not replace earlier evidence.",
    "Diagnostic failure does not alter original capture v1/draft schema, eligibility checks or final completion marker.",
    "Successful read observations are a diagnostic lower bound, never a complete boot/map closure or streaming permission."
  ],
